This directory contains the CMSIS device layer for the Nsing N32H76x
micro-controller. The files are taken from the N32H7xx-SDK
(https://github.com/Nsing-Community/N32H7xx-SDK), firmware/CMSIS/device
directory, and modified for the N32H76x port as described in ../README.
